# "Polukranos or another nontoken Hydra you control dies": "nontoken" qualifies only "another Hydra", so Polukranos itself triggers it as a token. Bot2 transforms its Polukranos on turn 2; Bot1's Fractured Identity on turn 3 exiles it and Bot1 (the player other than its controller) gets a token copy of Polukranos, Engine of Ruin; Bot1's Go for the Throat then kills that token, and its dies ability makes Bot1 the 3/3 green and white reach and lifelink Hydra tokens.

